{"continue":{"iistart":"2012-12-08T12:42:03Z","continue":"||"},"query":{"pages":{"23079498":{"pageid":23079498,"ns":6,"title":"File:Mosaic Portrait of the Poet Alcman.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":2718013,"width":2198,"height":2333,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg/1920px-Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1920,"thumbheight":2038,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg/1920px-Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1920,"height":2038,"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mosaic_Portrait_of_the_Poet_Alcman.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=23079498","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2022-03-25 18:49:09","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Mosaic Portrait of the Poet Alcman","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Alcman|Images with extracted images|Flickr images uploaded by Flickr upload bot|Notable people in ancient Roman mosaics|Files from ellenm1 Flickr stream|Mosaics in Jerash","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>Mosaic Portrait of the Poet Alkman\nStone tesserae, mortar \nRoman Period (late 2nd-3rd century AD)\nJerash, Jordan\n</p><p>This imaginary portrait of the Greek lyric poet Alkman (6th century BC) once formed part of the border of a large floor mosaic, along with portraits of other ancient Greek authors, the Seasons, and the Muses. Scenes from the life of the Greek god Dionysos filled the center of the mosaic, which probably adorned a dining room, or triclinium, in ancient Gerasa (modern Jerash). \n</p>\nThe revelries of the god of wine were an appropriate subject for a dining room, where guests consumed wine served in elegant glasses and feasted on lavishly prepared foods. The portraits o Alkman and other classic Greek writers allude to the coultured conversation and display of learning that took place at elite dinner parties throughout the Roman Mediterranean.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2010-10-28 14:01:07","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Flickr\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flickr\">Flickr</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/47051377@N00/5124527759\">Mosaic Portrait of the Poet Alkman</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/47051377@N00\">ellenm1</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table id=\"FlickrReview\" style=\"width:100%; margin:0.3em auto; text-align:start; background-color:var(--background-color-success-subtle,#d5fdf4); padding: 3px; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#a2a9b1); color:inherit;\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikip